t items share cooldowns between Meepos, except Teleport Scrolls. Damage, attack speed, health, mana, regeneration, mana burn, and proc chance bonuses from items are distributed equally among the amount of Meepos, making them %dps_penalty_pct%%% less effective. If any Meepo dies, they all die.", "facets_loc": ["Can now be upgraded at level %required_level% and every %bonus_levels_between_upgrades% levels afterwards to a max level of %max_level%. Duplicate Meepos receive %main_meepo_stats_pct%%% of the main Meepo's bonus attributes.", "All Meepos have a stackable aura that increases nearby Meepos' attack speed by %support_group_attack_speed_pct%%% and armor by %support_group_armor%. Radius: %support_radius%."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Meepo summons another Meepo, which levels up and shares items with the main Meepo. Ability cooldowns are independent, but items share cooldowns between Meepos, except Teleport Scrolls. Damage, attack speed, health, mana, regeneration, mana burn, and proc chance bonuses from items are distributed equally among the amount of Meepos, making them %dps_penalty_pct%%% less effective. If any Meepo dies, they all die. Experience gained by any Meepo is decreased proportionally by the number of Meepos that have gained experience in the last %xp_penalty_time%s.", "shard_loc": "Divided We Stand can be cast to pick up the target friendly Meepo or creep, disarming Meepo and disabling them. Use the sub-ability to throw the carried unit at the target, dealing damage and slowing enemies within %radius_tooltip% radius of the impact. If the carried target is a Meepo, it shares damage with the carrier. The carried target will be dropped if not thrown in time.", "facets_loc": ["Can now be upgraded at level %required_level% and every %bonus_levels_between_upgrades% levels afterwards to a max level of %max_level%. Duplicate Meepos receive %main_meepo_stats_pct%%% of the main Meepo's bonus attributes.", "All Meepos have a stackable aura that increases nearby