rable and untargetable for %duration%s. Restores %hp_restore%%% of his max health over that duration. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel"}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Digs into the ground for a short duration, dispelling Meepo and causing him to become invulnerable and untargetable for %duration%s. Restores %hp_restore%%% of his max health over that duration. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel"}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_points", "old": [0.3], "new": [0.2]}, {"field": "AbilityCastPoint", "old": {"base": [0.3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0.2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "duration", "old": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [4], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "hp_restore", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "1ded141b4ca97ab1b964", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:meepo_petrify:healing:shard", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "4d75fdf84cc7416548d4", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "meepo_poof", "name_zh": "米波·忽悠", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Drawing mystical energies from the earth, a Meepo can teleport to another Meepo or itself after channeling for %cast_duration% seconds, damaging the enemy in both the departure and arrival locations. If the ability is in alt-cast state, all Meepos will also cast Poof to the target. When cast on the ground, all Meepos except the selected one will Poof to the closest location.", "notes_loc": ["Can be cast through the minimap.", "Can teleport to Meepo illusions."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Drawing mystical energies from the earth, a Meepo can teleport to another Meepo or itself after channeling for %cast_duration% seconds, damaging the enemy in both the departure and arrival locations. If the ability is in alt-cast state, all Meepos will also cast Poof to the target. When cast on the ground, all Meepos except the selected one will Poof to the closest location.", "notes_loc": ["Can be cast through the minimap.", "Can teleport to Meepo illusions."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "ability_has_scepter", "old": true, "new": false}, {"field": "megameepo_poof_scaling", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": [50], "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "2fa6587ff4230cfa24c1", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "7056861bb759c22212b6", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f3308f6ea0d8cb0aa5ca", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "mekansm", "name_zh": "梅肯斯姆", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Restore Restores %heal_amount% health to allied units in a %heal_radius% radius. Passive: Mekansm Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allied units in a %aura_radius% radius.", "notes_loc": ["Restore does not affect units that have been affected by Restore or Guardian Greaves Mend within Mekansm's cooldown.", "Multiple instances of Mekansm Aura do not stack."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Restore Restores %heal_amount% health to allied units in a %heal_radius% radius. Passive: Mekansm Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allied units in a %aura_radius% radius.", "notes_loc": ["Restore does not affect units that have been affected by Restore or Guardian Greaves Mend within Mekansm's cooldown.", "Multiple instances of Mekansm Aura do not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "add_nostack_debuff", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "151614bb76ac04a1b3a0", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "5604e10b42e1a570aae3", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "6d9e2d1f32351c5c3a2d", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "meteor_hammer", "name_zh": "陨星锤", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Meteor Hammer CHANNELED - After a successful channel, summons a meteor that strikes a %impact_radius% AoE, stunning enemies for %stun_duration% seconds and dealing impact damage. Continues to deal damage over time to enemies units and buildings for %burn_duration% seconds. Non-building units are also slowed for %burn_slow%%% for the duration of the burn. Building Impact Damage: %impact_damage_buildings% Building Over Time Damage: %burn_dps_buildings% Non-Building Impact Damage: %impact_damage_units% Non-Building Over Time Damage: %burn_dps_units% Channel Duration: %max_duration% seconds. Landing Time: %land_time% seconds."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Meteor Hammer CHANNELED - After a %max_duration%s channel, summons a meteor after %land_time%s that strikes a %impact_radius% AoE, stunning enemies for %stun_duration%s and dealing %impact_damage_units% impact damage. Continues to deal %burn_dps_units% damage per second for %burn_duration%s. Non-building units are also slowed by %burn_slow%%% for %burn_duration%s. Deals %building_damage_pct%%% damage to buildings."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "item_cost", "old": 2850, "new": 2750}, {"field": "bonus_intellect", "old": {"base": [24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [22], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "building_damage_pct", "old": null, "new": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "burn_dps_buildings", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "burn_dps_units", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "burn_slow", "old": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "impact_damage_buildings", "old": {"base": [90], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "impact_damage_units", "old": {"base": [130], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [150], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "mana_regen_multiplier", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "spell_amp", "old": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "350878281232de541d3e", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "95b9db1c3a9654525662", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d3233ec39d303caa9574", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "aa301c5c529384ddb843", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a7b4e2df9ed0d5695600", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "8b99367292d9d6e96ca5", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_arrow", "name_zh": "米拉娜·月神之箭", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Fires a long-range arrow with deadly precision, which stuns and damages the first enemy unit it strikes. The stun duration ranges from %arrow_min_stun% to %arrow_max_stun% seconds, with bonus damage up to %arrow_bonus_damage% added, based on the distance the arrow travels to its target. Instantly kills the first non-ancient creep it hits.", "notes_loc": ["For every 150 distance the arrow travels, the stun duration upon impact increases by 0.5 seconds, and the bonus damage added increases by 14.", "Sacred Arrow can hit invisible units.", "Starstruck does not apply to the second Starstorm from Aghanim's Scepter."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Sacred Arrow to release a Starstorm on enemies along the travel path of the primary arrow, releasing a second Starstorm that deals less damage to the impacted unit."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Fires a long-range arrow with deadly precision, which stuns and damages the first enemy unit it strikes. The stun duration ranges from %arrow_min_stun% to %arrow_max_stun% seconds, with bonus damage up to %arrow_bonus_damage% added, based on the distance the arrow travels to its target. Instantly kills the first non-ancient creep it hits.", "notes_loc": ["For every 150 distance the arrow travels, the stun duration upon impact increases by 0.5 seconds, and the bonus damage added increases by 14.", "Sacred Arrow can hit invisible units.", "Starstruck does not apply to the second Starstorm from Aghanim's Scepter."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Sacred Arrow to release a Starstorm on enemies along the travel path of the primary arrow, releasing a second Starstorm that deals less damage to the impacted unit."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "scepter_starstorm_target_pct", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": [80], "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": [75], "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "acc2a9beff63d6370f8a", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "bd94f3d6985e73e6a06d", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e136e69d032ca4bad7ed", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "7afe5a93ba571ca165e4", "mechanism": "invisibility", "mechanism_zh": "隐身", "definition": "使自身、队友、召唤物或复制体隐身", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "92ba211c00c125cfcb22", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_celestial_quiver", "name_zh": "米拉娜·天界箭袋", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "When a charge is available, Mirana's next attack will deal bonus magic damage.", "shard_loc": "Grants %quiver_restore% temporary Charges while Leap's buff is active."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "When a charge is available, Mirana's next attack will have bonus item potency and magic damage.", "shard_loc": "Grants %quiver_restore% temporary Charges while Leap's buff is active."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_potency", "old": null, "new": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "092d8c40457cae1102c2", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e71f2879c4364758355e", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "8f509e8b17d6a3c79739", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a653e22098ee32b0ccb6", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e035b3631b3f315e51ff", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "3ff41d702fa85635cc08", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "9e056c72a092788cdca3", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_starfall", "name_zh": "米拉娜·群星风暴", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Calls down a wave of meteors to damage nearby enemy units. The closest enemy unit to Mirana in a %starfall_secondary_radius% radius will be struck a second time.", "notes_loc": ["Starstorm is not blocked by Linken's Sphere.", "Starstorm cannot hit invisible units.", "Starstorm will choose a new target for the second meteor if the first died before impact."], "facets_loc": ["Starstorm's second meteor deals more damage and blinds the target."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Calls down a wave of meteors to damage nearby enemy units. The closest enemy unit to Mirana in a %starfall_secondary_radius% radius will be struck a second time.", "notes_loc": ["Starstorm is not blocked by Linken's Sphere.", "Starstorm cannot hit invisible units.", "Starstorm will choose a new target for the second meteor if the first died before impact."], "facets_loc": ["Starstorm's second meteor deals more damage and blinds the target."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "4c0934fc12c58f5cfe0c", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "c91ec4a4e4150bbd8049", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "3566d879973592e31fe9", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "mjollnir", "name_zh": "雷神之锤", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Static Charge Places a charged shield on a target unit for %static_duration% seconds which has a %static_chance%%% chance to release a %static_damage% magical damage shocking bolt at a nearby attacker and %static_strikes% additional enemies. Passive: Chain Lightning Grants a %chain_chance%%% chance on attack to release a bolt of electricity that leaps between %chain_strikes% targets within a %chain_radius% radius, dealing %chain_damage% magical damage to each. Lightning proc pierces evasion.", "notes_loc": ["Static Charge cannot trigger more than once per second.", "Static Charge's shock deals magical damage centered on hero with the Static Charge. Static Charge's targets cannot be more than %static_seconary_radius% range away.", "Static Charge procs will not bounce to heroes that are invisible or hidden by Fog of War."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Static Charge Places a charged shield on a target unit for %static_duration% seconds which has a %static_chance%%% chance to release a %static_damage% magical damage shocking bolt at a nearby attacker and %static_strikes% additional enemies. Passive: Chain Lightning Grants a %chain_chance%%% chance on attack to release a bolt of electricity that leaps between %chain_strikes% targets within a %chain_radius% radius, dealing %chain_damage% magical damage to each. Lightning proc pierces evasion.", "notes_loc": ["Static Charge cannot trigger more than once per second.", "Static Charge's shock deals magical damage centered on hero with the Static Charge. Static Charge's targets cannot be more than %static_seconary_radius% range away.", "Static Charge procs will not bounce to heroes that are invisible or hidden by Fog of War.", "Chain Lightning does not trigger off of attacks from illusions."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "d8f463de4161b53eeeb0", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:mjollnir:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a7b2f4fa5f8c2108ffd9", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:mjollnir:damage_return:item", "mechanism": "damage_return", "mechanism_zh": "反伤", "definition": "受到攻击或伤害时触发的反击伤害：按比例返还所受伤害、固定值反击，或受伤触发的范围伤害（如半人马·反伤、斧王·反击螺旋、钢毛后背）；攻击者不一定被打到也算，记条件", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:mjollnir:pierce_evasion:item", "mechanism": "pierce_evasion", "mechanism_zh": "克敌机先", "definition": "攻击无视闪避（必中）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "monkey_king_bar", "name_zh": "金箍棒", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Pierce Grants each attack a %bonus_chance%%% chance to pierce through evasion and deal %bonus_chance_damage% bonus magical damage."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Pierce Grants each attack a %bonus_chance%%% chance to pierce through evasion and deal %bonus_chance_damage% bonus magical damage if the attacker is a hero or %bonus_chance_damage_illu% if the attacker is an illusion."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_chance_damage_illu", "old": null, "new": {"base": [30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_damage", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [55], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "melee_attack_range", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:monkey_king_bar:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "70b133abe29bb7366ae8", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "69b7ff8bf3df5d7ef222", "mechanism": "pierce_evasion", "mechanism_zh": "克敌机先", "definition": "攻击无视闪避（必中）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "monkey_king_boundless_strike", "name_zh": "齐天大圣·棒击大地", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King enlarges his staff and slams it against the ground, stunning enemies in a line and damaging them with bonus damage and a critical hit based on his attack. Has True Strike.", "shard_loc": "Boundless Strike applies Primal Spring with %spring_channel_pct%%% of the max channeling duration power to enemies along the staff and at the end of the staff. When Boundless Strike is set to alt-cast, Monkey King leaps to the end of his staff."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King enlarges his staff and slams it against the ground, stunning enemies in a line and damaging them with bonus damage and a critical hit based on his attack. Has True Strike.", "shard_loc": "Boundless Strike applies Primal Spring with %spring_channel_pct%%% of the max channeling duration power to enemies along the staff and at the end of the staff. When Boundless Strike is set to alt-cast, Monkey King leaps to the target position and Primal Spring damage is dealt around the jump area instead."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [24, 21, 18, 15], "new": [24, 20, 16, 12]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [24, 21, 18, 15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [24, 20, 16, 12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "strike_crit_mult", "old": {"base": [120, 140, 160, 180], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [120, 130, 140, 150], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "strike_flat_damage", "old": {"base": [20, 40, 60, 80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25, 50, 75, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "stun_duration", "old": {"base": [0.7, 0.9, 1.1, 1.3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0.75, 1, 1.25, 1.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "196e13aad5570abc144c", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "469371740e673370f3ca", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "97fbac5f04a1df58a307", "mechanism": "critical", "mechanism_zh": "暴击", "definition": "攻击造成额外倍数伤害；有概率触发或强化下一次攻击都算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "62c16e4f124719c724f2", "mechanism": "pierce_evasion", "mechanism_zh": "克敌机先", "definition": "攻击无视闪避（必中）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2514a6ca94a0eb37034c", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d8f88354b72289484de5", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:monkey_king_boundless_strike:terrain_walk:shard", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "monkey_king_jingu_mastery", "name_zh": "齐天大圣·如意棒法", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King's attacks awaken the Jingu Bang's power. Upon the fourth hit on the same enemy hero, Monkey King earns %charges% charged attacks that have bonus damage and lifesteal.", "notes_loc": ["Hitting an enemy with Boundless Strike adds to the hit counter.", "Repeatedly hitting an enemy refreshes the Jingu Mastery debuff duration.", "Hit charges on enemies cannot be dispelled.", "Jingu Mastery buff on self can be dispelled.", "Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King's attacks awaken the Jingu Bang's power. Upon the number of required hits on the same enemy hero, Monkey King earns %charges% charged attacks that have bonus damage and lifesteal.", "notes_loc": ["Hitting an enemy with Boundless Strike adds to the hit counter.", "Repeatedly hitting an enemy refreshes the Jingu Mastery debuff duration.", "Hit charges on enemies cannot be dispelled.", "Jingu Mastery buff on self can be dispelled.", "Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "951ab733220c08018ece", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:monkey_king_jingu_mastery:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a0f3b6edd97a6fc1364b", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ca5b8b28be76ee60befc", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "b98d9cb3f97685b19ed9", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "monkey_king_tree_dance", "name_zh": "齐天大圣·丛林之舞", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King jumps to a tree and perches atop it. While perched, he gains the Primal Spring ability-a channeled leap attack. If Monkey King's tree is destroyed, he falls and is stunned for %unperched_stunned_duration%s. Taking damage while on the ground puts Tree Dance on cooldown.", "notes_loc": ["Tree Dance cooldown starts upon landing.", "Right-clicking the ground will have Monkey King drop from the tree.", "Movement is interrupted if Monkey King is stunned, hexed or banished."], "facets_loc": ["Increases the max level of Tree Dance. Level %max_level% Tree Dance reduces the cooldown to zero."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Monkey King jumps to a tree and perches atop it. While perched, he gains the Primal Spring ability-a channeled leap attack. If Monkey King's tree is destroyed, he falls and is stunned for %unperched_stunned_duration%s. Taking damage while on the ground puts Tree Dance on cooldown.", "notes_loc": ["Tree Dance cooldown starts upon landing.", "Right-clicking the ground will have Monkey King drop from the tree.", "Movement is interrupted if Monkey King is stunned, hexed or banished."], "facets_loc": ["Increases the max level of Tree Dance. Level %max_level% Tree Dance reduces the cooldown to zero."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [900], "new": [1000]}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [900], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "ground_jump_distance", "old": {"base": [900], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "perched_jump_distance", "old": {"base": [900], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "range", "old": {"base": [900], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "ea54592f9d73e5167ab3", "mechanism": "channel_interrupt", "mechanism_zh": "打断持续施法", "definition": "说明明确写打断持续施法；眩晕、沉默等已有控制不重复记", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "ecc5be74eb452c399eaf", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "291319341e737eed6831", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "35b9692ce10d33023a6d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "555d6d74ad7695cd3986", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:monkey_king_tree_dance:terrain_walk:base", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "543b26e8da216dd5fc23", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "0598e1765c7cb1d40b29", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "morphling_replicate", "name_zh": "变体精灵·变形", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Morphling changes his form to match the targeted enemy, gaining their basic abilities and changing his primary attribute based on his target. Can be toggled for the duration of the ability.", "notes_loc": ["You can't target yourself with Morph.", "Morph won't copy Shard/Scepter abilities unless Morphling owns the respective item.", "Does not trigger spell reflect."], "scepter_loc": "Adds an alt-cast to Morph. When enabled, a strong illusion is created of the target hero that can cast all of the hero's basic abilities. If the illusion is alive when Morphling toggles the ability, he will take the place of the illusion, destroying it."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Morphling changes his form to match the targeted enemy, gaining their basic abilities and changing his primary attribute based on his target. Can be toggled for the duration of the ability.", "notes_loc": ["You can't target yourself with Morph.", "Morph won't copy Shard/Scepter abilities unless Morphling owns the respective item.", "Does not trigger spell reflect."], "scepter_loc": "While Morph is active, every time Morphling casts a unit-targeted spell, %scepter_echo_count% lesser replicants appear one after another %scepter_echo_cast_delay% seconds apart, and cast it again at a nearby target, or the same target if no other valid targets are available. Every echo is weaker, dealing less damage, healing less health, and applying shorter buffs/debuffs than the previous one."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "scepter_additional_stats", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": [20], "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "scepter_attack_speed", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": [70], "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "scepter_echo_appear_distance", "old": null, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": [150], "shard": null}}, {"field": "scepter_echo_cast_delay", "old": null, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": [0.2], "shard": null}}, {"field": "scepter_echo_count", "old": null, "new": {"base"